  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The work to which this consent relates shall be begun not later than three years from the date of this consent. \r\nReason: To comply with the requirements of Section 18 of the Planning (Listed Buildings and Conservation Areas) Act 1990, Section 51 of the Planning and Compulsory Purchase Act 2004 and the Town and Country Planning (Development Management Procedure) (England) Order 2015.\r\n",
    "Condition : 2 - The works of demolition/alteration hereby authorised shall be carried out in complete accordance with the following plans and specifications:\r\nPL 10, PL 02, PL 06, PL 07, PL 09, PL 08, PL 01, PL 03, PL 04, PL 05, Document titled DAIKIN INSTALLATION MANUAL PART 1 dated 22nd September 2025, Document titled DAIKIN INSTALLATION MANUAL PART 2 dated 22nd September 2025, Document titled IRONMONOGERY, DOORS AND SHELVES dated 14th November 2025\r\nReason: To safeguard the character of the building, in accordance with Council policy LP3 of the Local Plan.\r\n"
  ],
